 dict(title='Other people had seen the evidence.',body='She describes probation involvement, an NSPCC assessment of the father, and a guardian examining her records and responding positively.',time='06:32–07:35',sec=392,kind='Woods’s account',a='ASSESSMENTS + FILE',b='GUARDIAN EXAMINES',meaning='The story identifies other records and a witness who could test what the file contained.',check='The assessments, guardian’s report and copies of the file reviewed.'),
